    "sections": {
        "description": "A block theme for writing that people read to the end. A quiet sidebar holds the name, the menu and the search, and every article sits on its own sheet in type made for long reading. Readers choose the text size and light or dark, and a focus mode steps the controls back while they read. Long posts get a contents list from their headings, each post format has its own card on the blog page, and an archive page lists every post by year. Pair it with the free Vibetiles plugin to make the design your own: colours, fonts, sizes and spacing, changed live on the page."
    },
